version=4.1.14
4.1.14  Unofficial Pi 5 / Debian 13 (Trixie) fork of km4ack/73Linux 4.1.13
        Restore Raspberry Pi (aarch64) support dropped upstream in 4.1.9
        Install tree is always $HOME/73Linux; do not run as root
        Skip upstream self-replace when .pi5-trixie-fork is present
        Add bin/trixie-apt.sh for Trixie package name fallbacks
          libfuse2 -> libfuse2t64
          libasound2 -> libasound2t64
          libgtk-3-0 / libglib2.0-0 t64 names
          php8.2 -> php8.4 (or php8.3 / php)
          swig4.0 -> swig
        W1HKJ downloads use https://www.w1hkj.org (www.w1hkj.com 404s)
        FLDIGI, FLRIG, FLAMP, FLMSG, FLNET, FLWRAP, flxmlrpc
        FLRIG falls back to Debian flrig package if the source build fails
        Hamlib no longer pinned to 4.4; resolve current SourceForge release
        CHIRP uses libfuse2t64/fuse3 on Trixie
        set-enviroment.sh is user-space only (no sudo)
        Recognize debian / raspios / Trixie and Raspberry Pi 5 device-tree
        bootstrap.sh overlays patches onto official km4ack/73Linux
